| desc = Can be applied on [[debuff immune]] enemy units.
}}
{{Phylacterynotes
| name = Ion Shell
| desc = Does not proc [[Empower Spell]] on the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy.
}}

{{Debuffnotes
| name = Normal Punch
| desc = The {{M|forced movement}} applied no longer affects the [[debuff immune]] enemy unit.
}} 
{{Draftnotes
| name = Normal Punch
| desc = Requires drafting {{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{A|Dark Seer|Wall of Replica}} to unlock this ability.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Normal Punch icon0}}
| desc = Passive ability. Causes Dark Seer's next attack on a hero to have True Strike, knock a replica out of the victim, damaging and stunning them based on how far Dark Seer has moved in the past 3 seconds. Max power is reached after 1100 distance moved.
}}
* Directly uses {{A|Dark Seer|Wall of Replica}}'s {{M|illusion}} values, the illusion deals 80% {{M|outgoing damage|t=p}} by default if the ability is not learned.

* {{Symbol|fx|v}} {{Symbol|fx|s}}
** The ability effects starts upon Dark Seer's {{M|attack point}}.
** Both the ability visual and sound effects upgrade 2 times based on its distance counter:
*** <ab>Dark Seer Normal Punch 2.mp3</ab> At 300-distance.
*** <ab>Dark Seer Normal Punch 3.mp3</ab> At 900-distance.
** Dark Seer's left hand has certain ability particles when Normal Punch has max ability values.
*** Although ability effects are applied upon a successful attack, the pink punch ability animation is played upon Dark Seer's {{M|attack point}}.
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|invulnerable}}
*** Applies the ability effects upon knocking back an enemy unit.
*** Has no gameplay impact.
*** The ability effects duration is defined as:
**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|EffectsDuration {{=}} [[Illusion]]SpawnDelay}}

* The ability values changes per {{#var:Normal Punch basic1}}-distance moved per {{M|server tick}} moved as follows:
** {{Symbol|a|up}}
*** {{#expr:({{#var:Normal Punch value6}}-{{#var:Normal Punch value5}})/{{#var:Normal Punch value2}}*{{#var:Normal Punch basic1}} round3}} {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
*** {{#expr:({{#var:Normal Punch value4}}-{{#var:Normal Punch value3}})/{{#var:Normal Punch value2}}*{{#var:Normal Punch basic1}} round3}}-distance {{M|knockback}}.
*** {{#expr:(({{#var:Normal Punch value8}}-{{#var:Normal Punch value7}})/{{#var:Normal Punch value2}}*{{#var:Normal Punch basic1}})/2 round3}}-second knock duration.
*** {{#expr:({{#var:Normal Punch value8}}-{{#var:Normal Punch value7}})/{{#var:Normal Punch value2}}*{{#var:Normal Punch basic1}} round3}}-second {{M|stun}} duration.

