fields.value:
{{Debuffnotes
| name = Ion Shell
| desc = Can be applied on [[debuff immune]] enemy units.
}}
{{Phylacterynotes
| name = Ion Shell
| desc = Does not proc [[Empower Spell]] on the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} unit-targeted enemy.
}}

 * The {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|dark_seer_ion_shell}}-affected unit is not damaged.
** Can be cast on both enemy and allied units.
** Cannot be cast on {{M|Couriers}}.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*** Only damages enemy units.
*** Affects the following units:
**** {{M|Invisible}} units.
***** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
****** However, the ability effects indicating the damage intervals applied do not visually appear.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
*** {{M|Disable Help}} on Dark Seer prevents Ion Shell from affecting the allied hero.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** {{M|Doubletap}} casts the ability on Dark Seer.

* {{Code|dark_seer_ion_shell}}
** The applied modifier of different sources works independently of each other.
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} or {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} 
*** Reapplying the ability on the same unit refreshes its duration, update all ability values, and continue applying its {{M|spell damage}} in the same intervals as the first cast.
*** The latest ability cast on the affected unit updates the modifier, and damage enemy units of the latest caster.
**** However, the modifier status does not update.
**** Whether the applied modifier is considered a buff or debuff is determined upon the first cast, and is not updated on refresh.
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}}
*** Deals {{calc|v1*{{#var:Ion Shell basic1}}|v1={{#var:Ion Shell value2}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t3l}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{#var:Ion Shell basic1}}|v1={{#var:Ion Shell value2 tal}}}}|20tal}}) {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} in {{#var:Ion Shell basic1}}-second intervals, over {{calc|v1/{{#var:Ion Shell basic1}}-1|v1={{#var:Ion Shell value3}}}} damage instances, starting {{#var:Ion Shell basic1}} seconds after cast.
*** Leveling up the ability does not update the ability values of the current instance.

* {{cf|talnotes}}
** Most Ion Shell {{M|talent|t=t0|text=talents}} do not immediately update the current instance, except the {{ValueColor||damage increasing|20tal}} {{M|talent|t=t3l|x}}.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Ion Shell icon0}}
| desc = Surrounds the target unit with a bristling shield that damages enemy units in an area around it.
}}
* Deals up to {{calc|v1*v2|v1={{#var:Ion Shell value2}}|v2={{#var:Ion Shell value3}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t3l}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*v2|v1={{#var:Ion Shell value2 tal}}|v2={{#var:Ion Shell value3}}}}|20tal}}) {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} ([[before reductions]]) for the entire duration.

* {{cf|talnotes}} Acquiring the {{ValueColor||charges|25tal}} {{M|talent|t=t4r}} immediately grants {{ValueColor||1|25tal}} extra charge.

